{"total_count":2,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/10580","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/10580/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/10580/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/10580/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/10580","id":6411935711,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABPaT3bQ","number":10580,"title":"fix(quota): register openrouter as shell pool, groq as non-pool service (#10575)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-aiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:complete","name":"audit:complete","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"PR fully implemented spawning issue","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-11-16T00:59:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:12:45Z","closed_at":"2026-11-16T01:00:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/10580","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/10580","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/10580.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/10580.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-16T01:00:23Z"},"body":"Closes #10575.\n\nRegistration decision for the two providers the Plans Space Freshness Keeper found measured but unregistered in the 2026-11-16 quota-current tick:\n\n- **openrouter — registered pool.** Added to `SHELL_POOLS` in `pm-stack/aggregator/src/quota-extract.ts`, mirroring the mistral shell-pool registration: identity-only in the dated view, live windows overlaid by `overlayQuotaCurrent`. Rationale: the free-tier door was enabled 2026-11-15 (commit b68f134124) and its read is measured `ok` with a real monthly window (pctOfLimit 0, resets 2026-12-01) — it is a burnable pool in its own right, not a synthesized unmapped row.\n- **groq — registered non-pool service.** Added to `NON_POOL_SERVICE_IDS` in `pm-stack/aggregator/src/quota-current.ts`, with the reason in the set's doc comment. Groq exposes no first-party quota surface (failureClass `no-quota-surface`; limits exist only as inference-response headers / the console Limits page), so its gatherer row is permanently error-state with no windows; synthesizing a pool for it would render an identity-only pool that can never carry a measurement. The gatherer summary still reports the row; only pool synthesis is exempted. A gatherer-side change (not reporting an unmeasurable provider) stays with the quota-gatherer guardian.\n\nTests:\n- New measured-provider census (#10575) in `quota-gather-map.test.ts` for the 2026-11-16 tick: groq resolves to a documented non-pool id, openrouter to a registered pool. The #10443 census mirror set gains `groq` to stay accurate.\n- New overlay test in `quota-current.test.ts`: a groq error row synthesizes no pool while an unregistered control id still does, and the groq row still appears in the gatherer summary.\n- `quota.test.ts`: pool-order expectation gains `openrouter`; the \"fixture disabled set emits no pool\" assertion is updated **deliberately** — it now covers github-copilot only and asserts openrouter IS registered, because its premise (openrouter is a disabled door no pool answers to) ended with the 2026-11-15 enablement.\n\nVerification: targeted suites (quota-gather-map, quota-current, quota) 164 pass / 0 fail; full aggregator suite and tsc results recorded on task 17400 / issue #10575 at completion.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797382793&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=10580&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F10580&signature=bd8444ee383155a7306ba97e389151886cdacd1cc85de29774f8b5bb1962f1ec\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/10580?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/10580/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/10580/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3737","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3737/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3737/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3737/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3737","id":6148294627,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABMH1IVg","number":3737,"title":"test(aggregator): cover Cost Explorer client computations","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-11-01T14:51:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:47:33Z","closed_at":"2026-11-03T14:47:30Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/3737","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3737","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3737.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3737.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-03T14:47:30Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\n```text\nrenderAa\n  loads /assets/aa-explorer-computations.js as a module\n    imported by Bun regression tests too\nserver\n  serves the same pure computation asset\n```\n\nThe shared module contains percentile, Pareto, Pareto-gap filtering, banding, recommendation ranking, normalization, and task-projection calculations. The browser and tests now execute the same implementations.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** the Cost Explorer client was a large inline script; existing coverage checked that it parsed and rendered markup, not its calculation results.\n- **After:** `bun test test/aa-explorer-computations.test.ts test/aa.test.ts test/a11y-1215.test.ts` — 45 pass, 0 fail. Tests cover the Luna recorded-rate projection (~$0.10575/task, ~5m53s) and the emitted page-to-asset path.\n- Full aggregator suite: 888 pass; one failure at `test/slice3.test.ts:506` reproduced on clean `main`.\n- `bunx tsc --noEmit` reports existing unrelated errors; the same diagnostics reproduce on clean `main`.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** Two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** Narrow\n\nThe page loads one additional same-origin static module; calculations are moved, not intentionally changed.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/3737?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img al